sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant H as Depot handheld app
  participant P as Northwind Platform
  participant I as Scan ingest
  participant T as Tracking service
  participant S as Tracking store
  participant N as Customer notification<br/>service
  participant M as Messaging provider
  participant A as Tracking API
  participant W as Customer website
  H->>P: Scan (parcel, depot, scan time)
  P->>I: Deliver on parcels.scans
  I->>I: Validate, drop duplicates, order by scan time
  I->>T: Ordered scan
  T->>S: Append to timeline, derive status
  T->>P: Publish on parcels.status-changed
  P->>N: Deliver status change
  N->>S: Read contact and preference
  N->>M: Send email or SMS
  M-->>N: Delivery result
  W->>A: Lookup by parcel number and postcode
  A->>S: Read the timeline
  A-->>W: Status and timeline summary
